{"seq":1,"slug":"mind-and-principle","title":"Mind And Principle","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/ideas-and-methods/mind-and-principle","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"no-principle-outside-mind","title":"心外无理","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/ideas-and-methods/mind-and-principle/no-principle-outside-mind","wordCount":2042,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"against-zhu-xi","title":"与朱熹的分歧","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/ideas-and-methods/mind-and-principle/against-zhu-xi","wordCount":1837,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"本章呈现王阳明\"心即理\"思想的展开。\"心外无理\"主张天理就在本心之中；\"心外无物\"则以\"岩中花树\"的对话，揭示物的意义与呈现离不开人心的照察——二者共同确立了\"心\"作为道德与意义之根源的根本地位。本章还辨析了王阳明与朱熹在\"理\"的根源、\"格物\"的含义、工夫繁简上的根本分歧。这场\"朱王之辩\"，是中国思想史上的一场伟大论辩。\n"}